{%- comment -%}
  RAVA: hidden line item property with the original scent, for staff on the order page.
  The leading underscore hides it from the customer in the cart, at checkout and in emails; Shopify still shows it
  in the admin order. Put inside a product form.

  * product: the product the form adds
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign rava_recreation_value = product.metafields.custom.inspired_by.value | strip -%}
{%- if rava_recreation_value != blank -%}
  <input type="hidden" name="properties[_Recreation of]" value="{{ rava_recreation_value | escape }}">
{%- endif -%}
